    title: 'NTT DATA',
    text: 'Enterprise delivery across banking, insurance and public-sector ecosystems with technical leadership and modern frontend architecture.',
  },
  {
    chapter: 'Chapter II',
    title: 'Kabeli',
    text: 'Frontend leadership for allocation platforms, microfrontends and cloud-integrated enterprise products.',
  },
  {
    chapter: 'Chapter III',
    title: 'Epidata',
    text: 'Engineering consultant work focused on scalable web applications, product delivery and integration quality.',
  },
  {
    chapter: 'Chapter IV',
